    "$t": "網望"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span></span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhYNk_bzchPDQ5vr-2svQQJWxAHP-bPSeJW2RvUYULv_fhKTSjtZwYCcU__zQ1HO1u0WQ0-Ve4dUF902rz_7qYZvO_yr4o7i4OharnIUu50X85_SzsKLGTDd3EidgKFFcL7GidKGHz6QhJBK-1pswYCsHol9YUZnqg_s1MWEquF6HXs6K_3UrTSp8wYvbEk/s2688/%E7%B6%B2%E5%A4%A2%C3%AA%E5%9C%96.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1520\" data-original-width=\"2688\" height=\"362\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhYNk_bzchPDQ5vr-2svQQJWxAHP-bPSeJW2RvUYULv_fhKTSjtZwYCcU__zQ1HO1u0WQ0-Ve4dUF902rz_7qYZvO_yr4o7i4OharnIUu50X85_SzsKLGTDd3EidgKFFcL7GidKGHz6QhJBK-1pswYCsHol9YUZnqg_s1MWEquF6HXs6K_3UrTSp8wYvbEk/w640-h362/%E7%B6%B2%E5%A4%A2%C3%AA%E5%9C%96.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><br /><b><br /></b></span></span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張寶明</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">白tsiánn無味ê滾水</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">摻臭酸汗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">泡魚網</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">成就滿腹ê ǹg望</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">純真無邪ê手面</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">抹臭tsho風</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thīnn魚網</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">豐收tīnn-tīnn ê欲望</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh來起帆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">走揣lām盡世間雜味ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　海產</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">放長長長ê網</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">網假pâu ê藍海</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">摻人味販賣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh再出海</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">縛ân糊滿閒仔話ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　繚索</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">牽長長長ê網</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">網假仙假tak ê世間</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">搵真情交陪</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">船頂ê tsit篷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">透外國ê色水</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">單純kah咖啡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tām甜ueh甜ueh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陸地ê tsit篷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">攪本國ê孤味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">坦橫kah保力達</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吞苦尾苦尾</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In lóng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">望網　網望</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh987zy6yNa86tcxQ9YOYYlW0oqKvaOLfv3lZhxE4c7SyEByJlhwkTiytWBCMZAipdVfrQiLLaxnZCu0Ypz0zo3Gd5wnwnmF6FapM5s91nrEPDyeHBLYzdtli7xhKJceyfTT3T7OnwjMYYeCVFneGRPr2tLYMkX6ATHNVADAw0M6MxnR9ECnZtUmnOTYEGQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh987zy6yNa86tcxQ9YOYYlW0oqKvaOLfv3lZhxE4c7SyEByJlhwkTiytWBCMZAipdVfrQiLLaxnZCu0Ypz0zo3Gd5wnwnmF6FapM5s91nrEPDyeHBLYzdtli7xhKJceyfTT3T7OnwjMYYeCVFneGRPr2tLYMkX6ATHNVADAw0M6MxnR9ECnZtUmnOTYEGQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjfPndxndbzL1Xz5oJSWAHQB-L2QLhk50yFgKaAuwlRl4sE-TqUZqiJSGYJdA0duH89Y8pGGaYtGnWTPdjDh5_I6drSOgW8l_yfu_vip0eU5BM8sEv01_3Wpd2DhAEwmakeTtsaBtEvDdEiE1SeQLN6fG3-36qvGwAqyOa9-BtiKz48ONHG9pGlA5m1rj4W/s1423/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1423\" data